{"meta":{"id":"cee:181995","type":"series","name":"My Sweet Tyrant","poster":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/ABDB8AAF-2FF7-77F7-9E8F-B2D5078CB0DD_poster.jpg","background":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/ABDB8AAF-2FF7-77F7-9E8F-B2D5078CB0DD_poster.jpg","description":"The romantic comedy follows the everyday life of an extremely tsundere (initially aloof and abrasive, but later kind-hearted) boy named Atsuhiro \"Akkun\" Kagari and his girlfriend Non \"Nontan\" Katagiri. Akkun's behavior is harsh toward Nontan with verbal abuse and neglect, but he actually is head-over-heels for her and habitually acts like a stalker by tailing her or eavesdropping. Nontan is oblivious to Akkun's stalker ways, and thinks his actions are cute.","releaseInfo":"2018","genres":["كوميدي","رومانسي","رسوم متحركة"],"cast":["Ayaka","Keisuke","Suwa","Suzuki","Tatsuhisa","Ueda"],"director":["Katagai Shin"],"imdbRating":"6.5","runtime":"4 min","videos":[{"id":"cee:181995","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 1","season":1,"episode":1,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/ABDB8AAF-2FF7-77F7-9E8F-B2D5078CB0DD_poster.jpg","released":"2018-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:181999","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 2","season":1,"episode":2,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/ED6829BF-E062-4920-8D6C-B82D9D3F2AEE_poster.jpg","released":"2018-01-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:182001","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 3","season":1,"episode":3,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/ED6829BF-E062-4920-8D6C-B82D9D3F2AEE_poster.jpg","released":"2018-01-03T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:182005","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 4","season":1,"episode":4,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/ED6829BF-E062-4920-8D6C-B82D9D3F2AEE_poster.jpg","released":"2018-01-04T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:182007","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 5","season":1,"episode":5,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/ED6829BF-E062-4920-8D6C-B82D9D3F2AEE_post